{
  "_note": "添加频道前的校验:拿 channelId 去取一次 RSS,确认这个频道真的存在、并取回它的名字。\n⚠️ `ok` 的判据取响应里必然存在的结构标记 `<yt:channelId>`,**不是「名字非空」** —— YouTube 对无效 id / 限流返回的是 1.6KB 的 HTML 错误页(200/404/500 都可能),此时所有 split 都取空,而流照报 success。\n【G23 豁免】管理页解析频道:用户提交了链接才跑,不是首屏;解析结果要新鲜。\n⚠️ 2026-10-04 加流内重试(dfkit.req_retry,与组件同一实现):YouTube RSS 全网间歇返 404/500、单次成功率约一半,不重试时用户粘一个真实存在的频道,有一半概率被告知「没找到这个频道」。管理页是用户手动触发、页面流 15s 预算,最多 5 次、6s 内发出最后一次。",
  "version": 1,
  "_lintCache": "exempt",
  "actions": [
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtT","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rawE","value":"$[if::(startsWith::(${cid},UC),1,0)]"}},
    {"action":"concurrent","items":[{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${rawE}"},"items":[{"action":"request","id":"raw0","params":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=${cid}","method":"GET","formatType":"string","header":{"User-Agent":"Numable"},"timeout":"4000"}}]}]},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"raw","value":"${raw0}"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtEl","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-${rtT}),0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtGo","value":"$[if::(lt::(${rtEl},6000),1,0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtTo","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::(8000-${rtEl}),0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rawN","value":"$[if::(contains::(${raw},<yt:channelId>),0,if::(eq::(${rawE},1),${rtGo},0))]"}},
    {"action":"concurrent","items":[{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${rawN}"},"items":[{"action":"request","id":"raw1","params":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=${cid}","method":"GET","formatType":"string","header":{"User-Agent":"Numable"},"timeout":"${rtTo}"}}]}]},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b1","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},
    {"op":"if","props":{"val":"${rawN}"},"items":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"raw","value":"${raw1}"}}]},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtEl","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-${rtT}),0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtGo","value":"$[if::(lt::(${rtEl},6000),1,0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtTo","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::(8000-${rtEl}),0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rawN","value":"$[if::(contains::(${raw},<yt:channelId>),0,if::(eq::(${rawE},1),${rtGo},0))]"}},
    {"action":"concurrent","items":[{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${rawN}"},"items":[{"action":"request","id":"raw2","params":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=${cid}","method":"GET","formatType":"string","header":{"User-Agent":"Numable"},"timeout":"${rtTo}"}}]}]},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b2","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},
    {"op":"if","props":{"val":"${rawN}"},"items":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"raw","value":"${raw2}"}}]},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtEl","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-${rtT}),0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtGo","value":"$[if::(lt::(${rtEl},6000),1,0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtTo","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::(8000-${rtEl}),0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rawN","value":"$[if::(contains::(${raw},<yt:channelId>),0,if::(eq::(${rawE},1),${rtGo},0))]"}},
    {"action":"concurrent","items":[{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${rawN}"},"items":[{"action":"request","id":"raw3","params":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=${cid}","method":"GET","formatType":"string","header":{"User-Agent":"Numable"},"timeout":"${rtTo}"}}]}]},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b3","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},
    {"op":"if","props":{"val":"${rawN}"},"items":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"raw","value":"${raw3}"}}]},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtEl","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::(${@time.nowMs}-${rtT}),0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtGo","value":"$[if::(lt::(${rtEl},6000),1,0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rtTo","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::(8000-${rtEl}),0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"rawN","value":"$[if::(contains::(${raw},<yt:channelId>),0,if::(eq::(${rawE},1),${rtGo},0))]"}},
    {"action":"concurrent","items":[{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${rawN}"},"items":[{"action":"request","id":"raw4","params":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=${cid}","method":"GET","formatType":"string","header":{"User-Agent":"Numable"},"timeout":"${rtTo}"}}]}]},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b4","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},
    {"op":"if","props":{"val":"${rawN}"},"items":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"raw","value":"${raw4}"}}]},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"$[if::(contains::(${raw},<yt:channelId>),1,0)]"}},
    {"op":"set","props":{"key":"name","value":"$[index::(split::(index::(split::(${raw},<title>),1),</title>),0)]"}},
    {"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["ok","name"]}}
  ]
}
